---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import { SITE } from '../site.config';
---
<Base title="About" description={`Who writes ${SITE.name} and why you can trust it.`}>
  <h1>About {SITE.name}</h1>
  <p>Hi, I'm {SITE.author.name}. {SITE.author.bio}</p>
  <!-- TODO: 住んでいる年数、よく行く場所、自分の写真などを書く。
       Google は旅行記事で「実際に行った人か」を重視するので、ここは具体的に。 -->
  <h2>How I write these guides</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>I only recommend places I have visited myself.</li>
    <li>Prices, opening hours and access info are re-checked regularly. Each guide shows the date it was last checked.</li>
    <li>Some links are affiliate links. They never decide what I recommend. See the <a href="/disclosure/">disclosure</a>.</li>
  </ul>
</Base>
